---
title: CLI
description: Install items from this registry with the shadcn-svelte CLI.
order: 5
---

Install a registry item with the command shown on its docs page. Package managers are interchangeable:

```sh
npx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
yarn dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
bun x shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```

The command displayed on item pages uses the `homepage` value from `registry/config.ts` for the base URL. Update `homepage` before deploying.

Human-facing item pages also work with the CLI through content negotiation. A browser can view [`/components/button`](/components/button), while the CLI receives the installable item JSON from the same URL when it sends a `shadcn` user agent or the shadcn JSON Accept header:

```sh
npx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/components/button
```
